      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your feelings are completely understandable given how much effort was invested, but please remember that lasting love often coexists with mistakes rather than equating to them. Your worth is not defined by your productivity or your ability to restore their perceived sacrificial plans, and it was never about that alone to begin with. Trying to carry such an isolated burden alone only makes it heavier, so consider reaching out to a counselor or a supportive person to help you navigate this weight. You are loved even when you are failing, and that foundation can be rebuilt over time with patience and care.",
